cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si utiliza este software, cítelo usando los metadatos de este archivo."
type: software
title: "wdbc-pipeline: leakage-resistant repeated nested validation for the WDBC dataset"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline that benchmarks ten calibrated ensemble classifiers on the
  Wisconsin Diagnostic Breast Cancer dataset using repeated nested cross-validation,
  a code-enforced locked internal holdout, a fully nested operating threshold,
  bootstrap and exact confidence intervals, decision-curve analysis and explainability.
authors:
  - family-names: "Andrade Girón"
    given-names: "Daniel Cristóbal"
    affiliation: "Universidad Nacional José Faustino Sánchez Carrión"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9746-3583"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SU-USUARIO/wdbc-pipeline"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - breast cancer
  - nested cross-validation
  - calibration
  - reproducibility